                                                "sense_id": "693516cb-5ec3-322c-8e4a-ae502a1e01b5",
                                                "text": "Steve and I raced for the building and began climbing the wall, before any of the screws knew what was happening. […] The Corned Beef came out first and initiated the ploy to get us down."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
